<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Anglo sees record De Beers diamond sales.</title>
<headline>Anglo sees record De Beers diamond sales.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo American Corp of South Africa Ltd said on Tuesday that sister company De Beers would enjoy another record year of retail diamond sales.  </p>
<p>&quot;The U.S. market has been humming along and looks like it will have another record year...Japan has rather tailed off recently...The rest of the world is getting along satisfactorily,&quot; Julian Ogilvie Thompson, the Anglo chairman said.</p>
<p>&quot;Overall it looks like another record year in retail diamond sales.&quot;</p>
<p>Thompson added that the final level of 1996 sales would depend on the run-up to Christmas.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
